{"id":"vod_bf_36315","vodId":"36315","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"我的英雄学院第三季","name_cn":"我的英雄学院第三季","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-37/539ff790e427969cb7e81f196a1c2059.jpg"},"summary":"拥有名为“个性”的超常能力的人类的存在变得理所当然的世界。与No.1英雄·欧尔麦特相遇了的“无个性”少年·绿谷出久，小出他的隐藏的英雄资质被发现，并继承了欧尔麦特的“个性”——ONE FOR ALL。而后小出成功地进入了英雄辈出的名门校·雄英高校，与同学们过着互相比试切磋琢磨的每一天。　　雄英高校的学生们激烈比试的大活动「雄英体育祭」、在职业英雄手下磨练技艺的「职场体验」、与“英雄杀手”斯坦因的死斗、期末考试中与欧尔麦特的战斗，然后是与敌联合的死柄木吊的邂逅…。在一个个试炼面前，目标着成为职业英雄而果敢的站了出来的出久。另一方，死柄木与欧尔麦特的宿敌·ALL FOR ONE的同伴也增加了，并伺机蠢蠢欲动。为了成为最棒的英雄的出久的步伐、以及与敌人们的战斗，日渐加速！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 22:48:35","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wodeyingxiongxueyuandisanji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wodeyingxiongxueyuandisanji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wodeyingxiongxueyuandisanji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wodeyingxiongxueyuandisanji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wodeyingxiongxueyuandisanji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wodeyingxiongxueyuandisanji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wodeyingxiongxueyuandisanji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wodeyingxiongxueyuandisanji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wodeyingxiongxueyuandisanji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wodeyingxiongxueyuandisanji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wodeyingxiongxueyuandisanji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/